Imagine going to the Met in 2024.

3
00:00:06,440 --> 00:00:10,920
Imagine seeing the tone of the world shifting the way that it is.

4
00:00:11,020 --> 00:00:16,960
People finally waking up and crying out about pollution, corruption and overproduction,

5
00:00:17,200 --> 00:00:22,500
about genocide and proxy wars, about resource theft and child labor.

6
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:27,400
Imagine seeing all this happening before your very eyes and thinking,

7
00:00:27,400 --> 00:00:31,420
and you know what the world needs to be paying attention to right now?

8
00:00:31,540 --> 00:00:33,580
Me and my silly hat.

9
00:00:33,700 --> 00:00:36,760
Look at my hat, everybody. Isn't it just something?

10
00:00:36,960 --> 00:00:47,720
Imagine spending $75,000 on a ticket and God knows how much money, time, energy to play dress up as a monument to opulence

11
00:00:47,720 --> 00:00:55,020
and some kind of twisted, fucked up Hunger Games cosplay during a time when even the obedient people,

12
00:00:55,020 --> 00:01:02,580
even the people who did what they were told or looking at a future where they might not be able to do basic things like

13
00:01:02,580 --> 00:01:06,640
own a home, start a family or ever retire.

14
00:01:06,760 --> 00:01:15,340
Imagine seeing the president of a Western-backed, UN-recognized country publicly declare his intentions to commit

15
00:01:15,340 --> 00:01:19,880
yet more war crimes on the very same night and think,

16
00:01:20,020 --> 00:01:21,720
but I've already bought my hat.

17
00:01:21,840 --> 00:01:24,280
I can't cancel. They have to see it.

18
00:01:24,500 --> 00:01:26,680
Tonight is about me and my hat.

19
00:01:26,900 --> 00:01:27,460
Shame.

